#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:2
msgid "Loading a model"
msgstr "載入模型"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:4
msgid ""
":class:`ml.Model` reads a model file from flash, parses it, allocates the "
"RAM the network needs during inference, and returns an object that carries "
"everything the rest of the script needs to know about the loaded network."
msgstr ""
":class:`ml.Model` 會從快閃記憶體讀取模型檔案、進行解析、配置網路推論期間所需的 "
"RAM，並回傳一個物件，該物件帶有指令碼其餘部分需要知道的關於已載入網路的一切資訊。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:10
msgid "The constructor"
msgstr "建構子"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:12
msgid "The constructor takes a path and an optional post-processor::"
msgstr "建構子接受一個路徑與一個選用的後處理器：："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:17
msgid ""
"Models on ``/rom/`` (the flash-resident filesystem) are read in place: the "
"network's weights stay in flash and the loaded model spends only the tensor "
"arena's worth of RAM. Models on ``/sdcard/`` are copied into RAM at load "
"time, so the total cost is model file size plus tensor arena. Either path "
"works; the trade-off is RAM."
msgstr ""
"位於 ``/rom/``\\ "
"（常駐於快閃記憶體的檔案系統）上的模型會就地讀取：網路的權重保留在快閃記憶體中，而載入的模型只會耗用張量競技場（tensor arena）大小的 "
"RAM。位於 ``/sdcard/`` 上的模型則會在載入時複製到 RAM 中，因此總成本為模型檔案大小加上張量競技場。兩種路徑都可行；取捨的是 "
"RAM。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:23
msgid ""
"If a sibling ``.txt`` file with the same basename exists, its contents are "
"loaded into :attr:`~ml.Model.labels` automatically. The ``postprocess=`` "
"keyword registers a callable that :meth:`~ml.Model.predict` runs after each "
"inference."
msgstr ""
"如果存在一個同基底檔名的相鄰 ``.txt`` 檔案，其內容會自動載入到 :attr:`~ml.Model.labels` 中。\\ "
"``postprocess=`` 關鍵字會註冊一個可呼叫物件，\\ :meth:`~ml.Model.predict` 會在每次推論之後執行它。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:29
msgid "Read-only properties"
msgstr "唯讀屬性"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:31
msgid ""
"A loaded model exposes a small set of read-only properties that describe the"
" network without anyone running it."
msgstr "已載入的模型公開了一小組唯讀屬性，這些屬性無需任何人執行網路即可描述該網路。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:34
msgid "*File and memory.*"
msgstr "*檔案與記憶體。*"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:36
msgid ":attr:`~ml.Model.len` -- on-disk model file size, in bytes."
msgstr ":attr:`~ml.Model.len` -- 磁碟上模型檔案的大小，以位元組為單位。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:37
msgid ""
":attr:`~ml.Model.ram` -- size of the *tensor arena* the network needs for "
"its intermediate activations during inference, in bytes."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~ml.Model.ram` -- 網路在推論期間為其中間激活值所需的\\ *張量競技場*\\ （tensor "
"arena）大小，以位元組為單位。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:40
msgid "*Input tensors.*"
msgstr "*輸入張量。*"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:42
msgid ""
":attr:`~ml.Model.input_shape` -- a list of tuples, one per input tensor, "
"giving the shape the network expects. Vision networks have one input with "
"shape ``(1, H, W, C)``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~ml.Model.input_shape` -- 一個由元組組成的列表，每個輸入張量一個元組，給出網路所預期的形狀。視覺網路有一個形狀為"
" ``(1, H, W, C)`` 的輸入。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:45
msgid ""
":attr:`~ml.Model.input_dtype` -- list of single-character dtype codes "
"(``'b'`` int8, ``'B'`` uint8, ``'h'`` int16, ``'H'`` uint16, ``'f'`` "
"float32), one per input."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~ml.Model.input_dtype` -- 單字元 dtype 代碼的列表（\\ ``'b'`` int8、\\ ``'B'`` "
"uint8、\\ ``'h'`` int16、\\ ``'H'`` uint16、\\ ``'f'`` float32），每個輸入一個。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:48
msgid ""
":attr:`~ml.Model.input_scale` and :attr:`~ml.Model.input_zero_point` -- the "
"*quantization parameters* that convert between the real-valued input the "
"network was trained on and the integer representation the cam runs against."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~ml.Model.input_scale` 與 :attr:`~ml.Model.input_zero_point` -- "
"用於在網路訓練時所採用的實數值輸入與相機所執行的整數表示之間進行轉換的\\ *量化參數*\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:54
msgid ""
"*Output tensors.* Mirror of the input set: :attr:`~ml.Model.output_shape`, "
":attr:`~ml.Model.output_dtype`, :attr:`~ml.Model.output_scale`, "
":attr:`~ml.Model.output_zero_point`. Detection networks produce two or three"
" output tensors (boxes, confidence scores, sometimes class probabilities); "
"classification networks produce one."
msgstr ""
"*輸出張量。* 為輸入集合的鏡像：\\ :attr:`~ml.Model.output_shape`\\ 、\\ "
":attr:`~ml.Model.output_dtype`\\ 、\\ :attr:`~ml.Model.output_scale`\\ 、\\ "
":attr:`~ml.Model.output_zero_point`\\ "
"。偵測網路會產生兩到三個輸出張量（邊界框、信賴分數，有時還有類別機率）；分類網路則產生一個。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:61
msgid ""
"*Extras.* :attr:`~ml.Model.labels` is the class-name list loaded from the "
"sibling ``.txt`` file, or :data:`None`. :attr:`~ml.Model.postprocess` is the"
" registered post-processor, or :data:`None`."
msgstr ""
"*額外項目。* :attr:`~ml.Model.labels` 是從相鄰 ``.txt`` 檔案載入的類別名稱列表，否則為 "
":data:`None`\\ 。\\ :attr:`~ml.Model.postprocess` 是已註冊的後處理器，否則為 "
":data:`None`\\ 。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:67
msgid "Inspecting BlazeFace"
msgstr "檢視 BlazeFace"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:69
msgid ""
"Loading the shipped BlazeFace model and printing each property gives the "
"actual numbers::"
msgstr "載入隨附的 BlazeFace 模型並印出每個屬性，即可得到實際的數值：："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:89
msgid ""
"The numbers identify the network's interface concretely: a single ``(1, 128,"
" 128, 3)`` ``int8`` input tensor and two ``int8`` outputs -- one for box-"
"regression coefficients, one for per-anchor confidence scores. The "
"quantization parameters describe how those int8 values map to the real "
"floats the network was trained against; the post-processor uses them to undo"
" the quantization before decoding the boxes."
msgstr ""
"這些數值具體地識別出網路的介面：單一的 ``(1, 128, 128, 3)`` ``int8`` 輸入張量與兩個 ``int8`` 輸出 -- "
"一個用於邊界框迴歸係數，一個用於每個錨點的信賴分數。量化參數描述了那些 int8 "
"值如何對應到網路訓練時所採用的實數浮點值；後處理器會利用它們在解碼邊界框之前還原量化。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/ml/ml-module/loading-a-model.rst:97
msgid ""
"Every property is the single source of truth for what it describes. Scripts "
"read :attr:`~ml.Model.input_shape` to know what to capture at, read "
":attr:`~ml.Model.output_scale` and :attr:`~ml.Model.output_zero_point` to "
"decode tensors by hand, and read :attr:`~ml.Model.labels` for human-readable"
" class names -- never hard-coded, never assumed."
msgstr ""
"每個屬性都是其所描述內容的唯一真實來源。指令碼讀取 :attr:`~ml.Model.input_shape` 以得知要以何種規格擷取、讀取 "
":attr:`~ml.Model.output_scale` 與 :attr:`~ml.Model.output_zero_point` "
"以手動解碼張量、並讀取 :attr:`~ml.Model.labels` 以取得人類可讀的類別名稱 -- 絕不寫死，絕不臆測。"
